<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="h">1 TIMOTIUS</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim.</para>
  <para style="toca2">1 Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 TIMOTIUSI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Weraung We Rentenang Na Paulusi We Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="mt2">WERAUNG WE RETENANG NA PAULUSI</para>
  <para style="mt2">WE</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTIUSI</para>
  <para style="is">Kawio Aduna we 1 Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="ip">Timotiusi mamo nyontarai Keresteni we amiomang dina. I meriwa we Seni kong rasuri Paulusi, aino wiuwu Seni ne Arera we Weng pa we kawasa pai. Tamani mamo nyontarai Yunani dina, mae inyani mamo nyontarai Yaudi dina. Kong Paulusi yau Timotiusi we ne kumai tarai na Sen Kristusi anongpa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulusi kong Timotiusi uronta to bendari Epesusi, na wanapa demi Timotiusi nyai kong jemaatipai we dedawa nyontarai we entanyau kawio wemai wa paya. Mana mantauni donta to raora Makedonia paia. Interi anetatuata we dedu rang pea we teweri meraru to Epesusi wami, impaina soi weraung nini pai we Timotiusi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na weraung nei Paulusi derekamana we Timotiusi imbaromi riupi we Seni na wemai pampang. Kong deirorai we imbaro kewiowido nyontarai we entanyau kawio wetarai wa paya. Wo na Epesusi mamo nyontarai pe embe totoi entanyau anyau eaya warui Arera we Weng pa. Ya entanyau parari Kawio Musai soi pa, mana ya entanyau kawio wetarai wa. Ya etoyo tanari parari pi pitau, aino tandidau wa, tatang pi we tapuapa pe, imbaro Seni ingkai periri tata ki. Paurusi derekamana we Timotiusi imbaromi yua ya na paya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kong Paurusi denyau Timotius parari topitotoi we embedung we Kristusi ne jemaati paya pitoai entona pa, aino etong weweng pa kong embemamarang, etong sasara wa. Kong denyauwi parari topitotoi riupi we Yesus Kristusi na wemai kong piata nyontarai Kristeng paya pa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kawio na weraungnei kiutua toninapa:</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio retenang. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi derera we Timotiusi imbaro yua mantanyau pi wemai wa paya na Efesusi. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-20">1:3-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi denyau Timotiusi parari topitotoi embeng we nyontarai Keresteng pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 2:1-15">2:1-15</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 3:1-16">3:1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi derera we Timotiusi imbaro kewioaya anyau wetarai wa pa kong riupi na wemai. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-16">4:1-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi denyau parari topitotoi nyontarai tandoaoa ne tata pitoai tanari we tane neta paya pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 5:1-25">5:1-25</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 6:1-2a">6:1-2a</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulusi derekamang Timotius imbaro dong parari Seni ne Kawio wetarai pa na wemai. <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 6:2b-21">6:2b-21</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1-2" />We Timotiusi, neu kumai mantau na Seni, wo roao Yesusi mai parari yau paina!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:1-2">Arera nini pai napei yau Paulusi, rasuri we Kristus Yesusi. Ewe rasuri ne mamo tutu Allai tane Mampariri pai ne airora pa, kong Kristusi Yesusi tane Seni we tasanesari pai ne airorapa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:1-2">Yai Allai kong Kristus Yesusi tane Seni umuangso au, urong au bodu une weweng urona pinoma pa kong urong au bodu une madori pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Kis. 16:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 1:1-2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyau we mai wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Awe yo eratopong to raora Makedonia, yau yeirora au waro nuai na Epesusi kong wua nyontarai embetotoi na yana paya, imbaro endeo etanyau anyau wetarai wa pa eampe. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Kong topana weya imbaro endeo esuwa endukami we arari mai wa kong parari ene mandarong wia na ene woriaipai we menaing wa pe. Taubai yana kio marowa, kong dongwido Allai ne awia we tandearoni tera na tandoao Yesusi Kristusi pa. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Impaina anyau yoyo au topana toyanapa, imbaro jemaati paya esanewiwu oya na esanerarong we mai, na esanerarong we mamarang kong endoao Seni na wepitarai. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Mana nyontarai peayati etua anyau wetarai pa wa kong engkonta engkawio kawio piwe unawa pa. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Ya wo etoyo embe kuru akama Yaudi pa mana kawio etopana pa kong engkawio kangkuna we kawio pitarai pina pa, mantau ya esaneatori wa.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Tatawo tasaneaoa we Kawio we Musai soi pa weng kia, imbaro tatong pararia na wetarai. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Tata tato tasaneaoa we nyontarai endoaoa paya Allai dong mambapai wa, mana Allai dong mambapai we nyontarai entatipari kong we nyontarai embateta Allai paya. We nyontarai esomi we Allai wa paya kong nyontarai etong sasari pampang paya. We nyontarai etong amuna paya kong nyontarai entuang we Allai wa paya. We nyontarai emung entamami kong esinyami paya kong emung nyontarai eaya wauya pa, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />we nyontarai emaninyawari paya, we muang we emaninyawari waweriao yapa, we entapu nyontarai we embo ya, we embeangkakari, we empangpang kawio, kong nyontarai pa mateiea we etong piwe maiwa we soraweing anyau we tarai pa. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Anyau nini napei Arera Weweng we ra na Allai we dea wieia kong nyontarai nea etaparandini pai. Anyau yani I rioaoi we yau we embuwua.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi sopang piboki tutu Allai ne weweng pa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Yau yewa piboki baba mantaung we Kristusi Yesusi tane Seni. Tutu I piana dong paya we yau ewemampata we I, kong diri yau kong I rearoang yau we emai eru mariwa nini pai, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Awe rampa yau wo nyontarai we etatipa Kristusi kong yau tato nyontarai we engkangkani nyontarai we endoao Kristusi paya kong yau tato nyontarai yemamunai we nyontarai endoaoa paya. Mana Allai dong ne weweng baba raweina pa we yau, tutu na a yani eroaoi wami, impaina eruinari piwe yonapa wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Kis. 8:3</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Mana tane Seni denyawa pampang ne weweng dona pinoma we yau, donane eroaoi kong aneuwiwu we nyontarai ea na Kristusi Yesusi. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Kawio we yo etopana nina tarai kong tasanekakepana aiwara: “Kristusi Yesusi riato nunei ma we periri nyontarai we etong sasari paya,” kong naina ya engkai mamo yau yong sasari raweina pa. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Mana toyanapa yedu weweng babaraweina na Allai, imbaro na yau nyontarai we ewesasari raweina pai, Yesusi Kristusi denyawa aneaiwari pa. Kong yau ewekamang na nyontarai we ingkai endoaoi paya kong etadu embeng ki woroi-woroi pa. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Impaina Allai we Mananu we pitawa pai, meari andi tantuang wei kong tataparandini pampang pa! I mamo Allai we wieng kio woroi-woroi, mae tandeoi wa kong I meari we Seni pa. Taraitoapeina.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariwa we Timotiusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Timotiusi neu kumai pa au, mariwa nina yona we aupa, parari pitoai nabi paya piana engkawio kakera parari aupa. Imbaro na kawio kakera yana pa, au bomuna era tutu amuna we weng pa na anemurarong we memarang kong na anemurarong we mai. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Nyontarai pe embetotoi piana entampi esanerarong we mamarang pa impaina endoaoapa nai, <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />na ya mamo Himeniusi kong Aleksanderi asaru tato. Nyontarai ni asaru piana yong mambabati we asaru na yong asaru wu nyombatangpai, imbaro uranyau we umanaing warui ungkangkani Allai pa.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Parari tandau na jemaati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Retenang peino yau yeirora au imbaro bonyau jemaati paya we etewara we Allai, entandau wei, entandau kangkuna we nyontarai eaya wei, entopang piboki we Allai we nyontarai paya kuira, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />entandau we mananu paya kong we nyontarai endu wang baba wetedai paya kuira, imbaro tambeng na wemai kong na wemadori kong imbaro tambe nadi we Allai parari pitoai anewea pa. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Yanapa aino mai kong dong Allai tane Mampariripai anerarong merarising pa. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />I anewea imbaro nyontarai nea engkai etadu pariri kong endearoang we pitaraipa. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Wo Allai pe koiri ki, kong we wemadu na Allai kong nyontarai ne tata pa koiri tato andino Kristusi Yesusi, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />we piana dong netaraipai we pika nyontarai nea engkai warui ene sasaripa: na toyanapa Allai denyawa we na awe ra mai na pa, I anewe nyontarai paya kuira etadu pariri pa. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Kong yana aidonane Allai riuwa yau ewe rasuri we etopang Arera Weweng we nyontarai Yaudi wa paya, Arera wetarai parari Yesus Kristusi imbaro endoaoi. Pitoai etopana nina pa pitarai pina, eweangkari wa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2Tim. 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Parari nyontarai muang kong wawing na jemaati entandau pa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Yau aneuwe imbaro naina totoi ea mamo muang wauya entandau na esanerarong we mamarang, engkayou wa ete embemarowa wa. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Kong wawing paya esauma enetaraipa na kakaira kong esasung asung we una. Ya esu endukamipa na wemai kong emaranding endukamipa na pimaranding we mayea pa kong esasung asung we embowa na arga pa tadai pe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1Ptr. 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Mana wawing paya andi emaranding ya na enari piwe maipa, parari wawing we yesuni na wemai doyo tendau we Allai pa. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Na awe muang paya etoa etanyau na nadi rarong pa, wawing paya entuang weya kong engkawio wa mae entaraoa toyana. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Yau eroa we wawing paya we etanyau wa ete etairora muang paya pe, mana ya aidisa ki. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Tutu Allai samu Adami pampong, interi Hawai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Kej. 2:7</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Kong Adami di Nyombatang weangkaripa wa mana Hawai, impaina sarobang Allai ne uara pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Kej. 3:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Mana wawing wadi ingkai dedu pariri tutu dawing kumai, aino anerarong weng kong rioaoapi Kristusi mae aneo nyontarai pea weiya kong embeng na wemamarang we Allai ki.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Kamang we embedung we jemaati paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Kawio etopana nina tarai, aino matei doyo wewedung we jemaati paya mamo anewe piwe piboki pa kia. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Impaina wewedung we jemaati pai mamo, topitotoi kia andi esanomi weng. I mamo wieng kong nukepana we ne wawin koiri ki, riukepang anerarong, anekurayang, meyoi na wemai, merarising demang nyontarai na ne manupai, kong anemanuainung we denyau nyontarai na wemai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit. 1:6-9</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />I wo nyontarai we reo deinunung barui wa, anewe doamuna wa mana menaang. I wo nyontarai kio madori, kong rewe pe wa. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />I riuwai ne mandarong we piau pai na wemai kong denyau ne kumai paya enukepana kong entuang esomi wei. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Wo nyontarai pei riuwai mantauni ne mandarongpai wa, mamo topitotoikai riuwai Allai ne jemaati pai pae? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Nyontarai we do wewedung we jemaati pai mamo piana rioao Yesusi pe manyonato imbaro reo deparandinipe, wo ingkai Allai dong mambabati wei parari pampong pa dong mambabati we Nyombatangpai pa. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />I tato andi anompa weng na jemaati na ri wanea, imbaro nyontarai pei reo dedu kawio pea we dona dintatipari we sawa to Nyombatangpai warararong pa pe.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kamang we wepiata wewedung na jemaati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Toyana tato we empata we embedung we jemaati wauya wo nyontarai we emai, impaina nyontarai entuang weya kong esanerarong mamarang; endewe pe wa kong esanewe etunung barui angguri wa. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />Ya wo endoao anyau Keresteng we piana Allai kemang kong endukepana pitarai na esanerarong we kakawiri. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Impaina entou ya pampong wo, topino etadu ya etong sara pianea wa mamo, engkamang ya we empata na jemaatipai. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Toyana tato we ene wawing paya, ya mamo andi nyontarai we emai impaina nyontarai esomi weya, engkangkani nyontarai wa. Ya andi endukepang esanerarong pai kong na pipatotoi ea nyontarai endoao ya. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />We piata we embedung we jemaati mamo andi wieng nukepana we ne wawini koiri ki. I andi riuwai kumai neng wauya kong ne mandarong wadi na wepiboki. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Tutu nyontarai we empata na wemai na jemaati paya mamo, jemaat paya ingkai entuang weya kong na toyana pa empaya we entopang parari ene endoaoa we Yesus Kristusi pa na ematai wa.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Allai ne jemaati, wepiata anyau mamarang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Aneusara we ingkai emararu we epaio au, toyana ki mana etoi arera ninipai tato we au. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Impaina, parari yau emararu wa we eramantu wu au mamo, au piana remuaroana we topitotoi andi tambeng we mandarong Allai pa, aino Allai ne jemaati embeng di tata. Impaina tata wo tamparari riri we doa meitui tutu ne kawio pa. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Seni piana yepa anyuing we aneaerai parari pitoai tandoaoa pa naina pei:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">I denyawi netarai pai we nyontarai watang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kong Duainunung Mamarangpai denyawia we I wetarai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">mae mampang paya endeoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ne arerapa embuwua tatera na kawasa paya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kong I endoaoi na nunei tantenang</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">kong Allai riuwai I wieita na ne deapai to rora-marising.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi denyau Timotiusi we aneawario we etanyau we mai wapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Mana Duainunung Mamarang pai, sopang kamana kangkuna na awe rama wane, ingkai nyontarai peaya empora Kristusi interi etua duainunung weangkakari paya kong etongparari duainunung yani pai ne anyau pa. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />We etanyau anyau yani pai mamo nyontarai we embewasireri, ya etiri totoai we tarai pa kong we sarara pa wa. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Ya esua nyontarai paya we endidau pe kong etang pampinong roweang we esauwa we embe tapua pa pe. Mana roweang pa Allai nyari we tatang na tatong piboki soa we Allai, na nyontarai we piana endoao Kristusi paya kong endearoang anyau wetarai na Allai pa. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Tutu pitaubai we Allai nyaripa mai kong koiri tato wetapua wa, mamo aduta na topang piboki we Allai pa. <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />Wo roweangpa kai mamo wetapua wa, tutu Allai ne Arera pa kong tandau tatoni pai dona mamarang to.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mampata Kristus Yesusi we riupi na wemai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Anyau we etopana yana pa bonyauwa pampang we wua nemeta endoaoa paya, na toyana pa au we mampata Kristus Yesusi we rupi na wemai di au. Kong piyanapa tato dong paya we au we roao Allai ne Kawio pa kong rukepana anyau we taraio we piana bongpararia eampa. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Pika au warui arari piami we unawa pa kong piwe mai wa pa parari pitarai na Allai pa. Mae bonyau waweri au pampang we womi we Allai. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Tatanyau tanetarai pai we piaya pa mamo weunapa maiyea, mana topino tatanyau tanetarai pai pampang we tatong parari Allai ne awiapa mamo weuna kia we pitaupa. Wo yanapa aino kio wemai pa we tata na a nini kong na awe rama wane. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Kawio ninane tarai kong metaduta kai. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Yanapa aidonane tasuira kong tasaneaera pampang we tasanesa Allai we wieng pai. Andi dong pariripa we kawasapai, retenang mamo we nyontarai endoaoa paya. <verse eid="1TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Topana kong boirora taubai yana pa. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Remo pika nyontarai pei yau au we moiape tutu au boba waworu paina. Mana anemuaerai we wepianyauwa we nyontarai we endoaoa paya, na kawio topana pa na piwe bonapa, na anemuwiwupa kong na nemu wemamarang pa. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Ra sisu ingkai eramantupa au andi nukepana pitarai we boto Weraung mamarang pai we nyontarai paya, topana weya kong bonyau ya ki eramantu. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Au remo porandeni bong parari paya Allai dona we aupa na awe penatua pa embarawawura au pa kong nabi paya piana entopang arera we rana Allai pararia we aupa pe. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Bong parari piyana pa na pitarai imbaro nyontarai peaya endeo nemu roaoa pa we apai topong pa. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Rentatua nemutarai pai meari kong rentatua nemu anyau pa. Anemukangkuna na taubai yana pa, tutu we bona yana pa ingkai poriri au kong nyontarai we entarao au paya.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Pitoai nyontarai tandoaoa ne tanari we tane neta paya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Nemeta we endoaoa paya, we embe paituang paya etosara piea mamo remo wua ya na raumpui erape mana wua ya na aiwara parari tamamui. Kong we aimiomang paya mamo wua ya parari nemeta mantaung, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />bongsaiwao wawing paituang paya we nyamui kong wawing waworu paya we nemeta maia, na anemurarong wemei.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyau parari kabong paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Mentuang we kabong we tarai embeng meari paya. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Mana wawing kabong we ene kumai ete entapumi pa, mamo yatino retenang etanyau we embesarawiri mandarong mantau enempa wo, kong embai nyontarai paituang kong entapumi paya, tutu ai waua Allai anerarong pa. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Topino wawing kabong we tarai meari pai, we piana ne mandarongpai empikari memeari, i anesara we Allai kong nukepana na tendau diru raida. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Mana wawing kabong we anewe wieng na merarising pa, i wieng mana piana duainunungpai keda to. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Borekamang pininane na jemaatinei tantenang, imbaro endeo etosara pianea pe. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Mana nyontarai pa matei meidai dosaiwa neta aririra paya, kong mandarong mantau nembadi, i piana piora ne we rioaoapa kong i mioyawa raweing nyontarai we endoaoawa paya.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Topino wawing kabong we etong parari anyau nini pai aino andi mentoikamang esanomipa we jemaati empata ya pa mamo, ya wo piana ene pudape piatoru, we endidau ene muang koiri. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Kong nyontarai endearoang ya we anemai etong weweng, aino etongsaiwa ene kumai paya na wemai kio embaba, emarising empata nyontarai we endawu ene manupa ma pa, empata nyontarai we endoaoa paya, kong empata nyontarai we engkiari pi, kong emariwa kangkuna na mariwa we enari na wemai pa. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Wawing kabong we embepaituang wa paya mendeo mentoi kamasa pe, tutu ya esanewe muang pa paya ea mamo empika Kristusi. <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Na toyana engko mambabati we enetaraipai tutu ya piana empora arera we etoni we Seni pai. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Mae ya empika ene a pa na esua emati na nyontaraipa ene manupa, kong yanapa meariwa mana ya tato etanyau we engkangkani nyontarai esanomipa, kong esaro nyontarai ene kawio kong engkawio kawio wemai wa we andi engkawiora pa wa. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Impaina, yau aneuwe wawing kabong embe paituang wa nea endidau ea, kong ene kumai mae endewari mandarong mantau enempa imbaro we embe marowa we tata paya etadu pianea we etona tasanomi moyawa pe. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Wo wawing kabong peayati piana empikara warui Allai mae etua Nyombatangpai to. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Impaina nyontarai wawing ete muang we rioaoa pei, na ne mandarongpai ei we wawing kabong mamo i andi piata ya, mendeo mempika jemaati wadi andi empata ya pe, imbaro jemaati paya empata kabong we embe rarowai paya.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uara kong rang pe bototoiea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />We embedung na jemaati pa, we empata jemaati na wemai pa, mamo andi jemaati paya entuang weya kong etong wiwai weya. Retenang pa weengkawio kong etanyau paya. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Wo, Weraung Mamarang kewio doyo, “Au remo bongwido sapi wedampi na awe etoni meriwa aepapa pasibupai warui rawongpai pe” kong “Nyontarai we meriwapai i dedu wiwai na piwe meriwa napa.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Ul. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat. 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk. 10:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Nyontarai pei subakepang we wedung na jemaati pei we dong sarara pi mamo, remo moraru roaoa pe, mana nyontarai pe umbe kodu ete itombetoru we itondekamana keto.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Ul. 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Nyontaraipei dong sasari mamo, andi wua nyontarai yani na jemaati paya endena wau, imbaro ea wauya ematai. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Na Allai, Kristus Yesusi, kong mampang we diri yapa endenapa, yau yewara kangkuna imbaro au bongparari kamang we etopana we au waworu yana. Au andi bongparari kamang yana we nyontarai paya kuira kong boati rabuang. Mae na pitau bonapa remo anemo ei raweina warui ei pe. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Remo wowoau we warangbawu nyontarai pei we wedung we jemaati pa pe. Wo topino nyontarai yani dong sasari pea mamo, ingkai au tato bodu ne sasari yani. Impaina bongsaiwa nentarai nemupai na wemai imbaro bong sasari pea wa.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Mae remo bunung maria meari pe, mae bunung angguri katea tato imbaro piata anemu we yuipa we penang, wo we totoi ea mamo anemupai yui kong nemutaraipai wemambiri wa paina.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Nyontarai pe embetotoi etong sasari pa na mararu tandeoa na wekakawiri, mana sasari na nyontarai pe embetotoi etanyuina kong tanduinariawa mana ingkai ra dea. Impaina ya menduwa ya wa we endu jemaatipai pe. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Toyana tato piwe etona mai pa mararu we tandeoa, mana pi mai etonapa tato ya etanyuina wa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s">Anyau parari woming paya kong ene tuang paya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Nyontarai Keristeni we embe woming paya kuira, andi entuang we ene tuang paya, imbaromi nyontarai pa entatipa Allai anongpa pe ete tane anyaune pe. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Woming we ene tuang wauya embe Keristeng pa mamo esanepapi ya pe. Mana andi embesarawiri ene tuang wauya na wemai kia, tutu tuang we embesarawiri yapa nyontarai endoaoa kong we esanewiwu ya.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Paulusi kewio parari nyontarai we etanyau pi maipa wa kong parari esanewe pe pa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Pininapa kuira andi kowiora kong bonyauwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Nyontarai pa matei denyau anyau pei ea raweing warui anyau yana pa kong rioao wa we anyau wemai we rana tane Sen Yesus Kristusi ma pa, kong dong parari anyau na agama tanenei wa, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />nyontarai toyana pai kewio barui, mana riunari pianea wa. Anetatuatapa piana maiwa, yerai we biateta nyontarai kong dong amuna parari kawio sosiau we donama nyontarai esanerarong keraria we nyontarai ea ya, embe marowa, entatipa nyontarai kong entubakepang nyontarai, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />nyontarai pa embemarowa waweria kio manaing na ea wa. Ya esaneaoa wa we etiri totoai we tarai pa kong totoai we sarara pa, yana pa parari nyontarai pei dewa ne wetaraipa warui ya. Ya etorato topino etanyau parari Allai pa mamo ingkai etadu pi barui pa kong kio piea we ya. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Tarai we tasyomi we Allai memeari pa mae tasanetatuata we piyana maia to mamo tatadu wemai pa kia. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Wo na awe tasua to nunei ma pa tangko pikatuyanei wa, toyana tato tangko pikatuyanea wa na awe tamati tori warui nuneipa! <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Impaina tatadu roweang pea kong asung pea mamo mawayana to. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Mana nyontarai esane we ene pe pa barui pa mamo, mawa kia we ya entawa to pi sou ya pai ne paya pa kong pimamunapa santeta ya imbaro etong pimamunapa pitau ea kong piwe mai parari esanetatuatapa wa piyana pa dauya paina etadu we moyawa kong emanaing. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Tutu nyontarai we anerarong pa dawia kia we dedu pe pa mamo ingkai nyari wemoya wa pa kia. Wo nyontarai pe embetotoi yati anemai mamo esamupa we pe impaina emunua anyau keresteni pai ea wa, interi ya etadu didiwa tau we dona esanerarongpa manaing.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arera kuwuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Mana au wo Allai ne nyontarai di au, impaina andi au topira tori warui pitau yana. Bodawa kangkungna we moi na Allai renapa, we munuara we Allai, roao Kristusi, anemuwiwu nyontarai, anemuaiwarao uira we bodutapa, kong ponang we nyontarai. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Werai kangkuna we bongparari Kristusi ne anyaupa na pitarai imbaro bowa wueng ki woroi-woroi wane. Wo yanapai Allai yau au weapa kong au roa na nyontarai we empau pa endena wau we roao Kristusi pa. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Kong na Allai we dong asengpa we pitau nei renapa, kong Kristusi Yesusi renapa, we kewio na wetarai we Pontius Pilatusi pa, yeirorao pininane:<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Yoh. 18:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Bong parari airora yani na wetarai, na bong sarara wa, kio a we tane Sen Yesus Kristusi riataweri ma wane, <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />aino awe Allai mantauni ingkai kiutupa. I memeari we mananu pa; Andi mei we tataparandini, tedai raweina kong we Mananu we mananu na nunei kong we Seni we seni na nunei kia. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />I meari ki we suang we kaida wadi wa, I nyaina wedea we ei kikeuwi wa. Nyontarai pei reoi na a pei wami kong tarai nyontarai ne endeoiwa. Kong I memeari andi tantuang wei pa kong we mananu ki woroi-woroi pa! Taraitoapeina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Buewara we nyontarai enepibarui na nunei nini, imbaro endeo emayasa pe kong endeo esanesara we pitau we wata woroi wa pa pe. Mana esanesara we Allai we dong pitau nei kiai weria we tamararisini. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Topana weya imbaro etong wemaipa, esanerarongpai donung na pi mai pa, empata nyontarai pa matei tato kong embaramipa tapia pampinoma. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Topiyana mamo ya endurikui ra weweng parari we aiwawera weya, na awe rama wane. Na toyanapa ya ingkai etadu embengki woroi-woroi pa. <verse eid="1TI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Hei Timotiuse, borara pitoai Allai rioaoa we au pa. Topiratori warui kawio we kakawiri pa kong mamarang wa kong warui marowa pa we rana nyontarai pa embetotoi entopana we “Pi tarai pina” mana piyana pa tarai wa, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />tutu nyontarai pe embetotoi ya etanyaua pa kong na toyana pa entapira warui Seni ne anyau we piana tandoaoa pa. Seni ne weweng dona pinoma pa derua mia!<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>